  "postText": "<p><HTML><HEAD><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\"></HEAD><body></p>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/zgEfZaWRm53QehJNkfmM3xNNqHH6KYJOn3nm0v18tJgItiuiK3y1hd2LTDb54jSs5KvYv5f6d1BYQilFovAxwyNvJ77pvd2nRphARhsX6EyD6kxryGU8PwR7Pqk1zD6TjzPPYctQyhK3GIXNqd0rzlMOStWn7PCEh2uLGjUFiMUcYh71Oc3EwlBdkuejXm3p5WCCa5ow\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/231/c8cce94e1ce4daf20cdc1fce38e14494..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ねー！！！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">超久しぶりにmbtiやってみたよ</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">あっとのメイドになる前は</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">INFP（仲介者）だったんだけど、</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">INTP（論理学者）になってた！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">私って、論理的だったんだね、、</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">たしかに</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">メイドになってから</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">間違いなく性格とか考え方が</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">変わったと思う</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">それがしっかり反映されててびっくりした！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">昔はずっと人の目気にしてて</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">自信なかったけど、</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">いつの間にか変わってたみたい</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/SayuuYkNq5BgDUtjJpaZxDEpmZPEj3Hdy429GVmRlHPJ9IkZ13JxdjQCXb2O0aWRBfK6cFkfBjyW9mX4L8fUJgnvYwnl7KmbbXXl2JpL8XpHee4mBMpAxzBK3J773N2816pzdkY01VLn22lu95AldubKwsjGQA81WFJTVKKnwaoAK2ACSOppIHRJjA7K5ZhEqc8xy7Da\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/231/9c7598c39c23d819b5af9924732833ea..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/MOjWDaceRCezOUic2aOvjyqImzz3iw7rOQIpGAg9A3thiBhCPacqI6y029506zpmRf7t5ixdgVhTb4tMZmtXuLVxHnpoeVE6mpOTWQ1C5Hs61iYOblCHBKkG1ydiHU6jh6WYUfXyTVwPqEjHeNAh624OnvQ4W2OTU4IG3pnwpEQhGiI2LhqsuKJyXvjUoMcTLOsMs7Zg\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/231/dd76bb73283123c895bc4aeeeb98f302..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/F9wtTHakGISadj1VoL2kn7CQqjdqbaUeNqDAzgXrzEQm6xqEZbhhccH7GmSHbQtF0LrokvuORCEokRfsK3o9ewW6Mb7pIOJbBTzXWJBS4xp3beVKyFCsaoJtCY2SA9qIRfP47E0qENCJcj4fvnBAlI0s9tNdqWE077PrNcEm3xzi5FJkG4cDnpxjpnAlzmyOJE4E31g5\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/231/cb94a75999c1c85d9c3699406a1d2172..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/efoR28TzMMd6Qb8PEdu3UV6Ww1GOOMeOiSZGGcFpjrA5pN22x7AdnTYmY5JcUI2CSgG4n3qXfoQF1AeIBIByCkIxw9SgQihmpn8gsy5rq7b6x5B6gtyIBenBzPGHm6mQu22kSI0stShRh7tZiOSu7rtWQBlzdBMw30Y3zLeigKmmKzrA4QyIIbsA9204Zu8RJg5iAwRZ\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/231/f8bdb7d7dd71d31b2f6069bc29cfe956..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/ExfemJC41jDbdkTsf01C1cGd4yKtHJ1chnXFNaCbuYl1IqsrHjvgbDxFNbhWKFAkQq1dC73Rzu5vSeLSIUKKI88DrIZxuUGKo67ezZ4keN3mFmvn0AYVSRdiljOXvp8bFMQeTHpKWrZ8AO0KpgKLhRmoCTheG9mYgLTXZ5uRa4OB22mkg3Pb2FZTVl6jYQBstNb43c5v\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/231/08f07e99005a8fd6b35e52f9f779be40..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">あんま難しくて読む気なんなかったけど</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">結構あってるなっておもた！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">知らぬ間に、人に流されない自分ができてて嬉しい</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">これ、間違いなくみんなのおかげ過ぎる。</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">いっぱい褒めてくれて</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">いっぱいお話してくれてさ～</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">逆にメイドになる前は、</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">周りの人全員に好かれたい、嫌われたくない！って</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">おもってたんだけど</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">今は、私の好きな人に嫌われたくないって</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">考え方になってるんだ～</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">この考え方、でかすぎる</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">八方美人でいきてきたけど</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">本当に素を見せられる人がいなくなっちゃうから</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">今の生き方が、自分に合ってて</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">とっても幸せだな</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">みんなもやってみて！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">おねがい！しりたーい！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://www.16personalities.com/ja\"><a href=\"https://www.16personalities.com/ja\">https://www.16personalities.com/ja</a></a></div>\n<p></body></HTML></p>\n",
